OL,3,AJimmy Kimmel says interview with
OL,4,ADemocrat won't air on TV, cites
OL,5,Aregulator 'threats'
OL,6,
OL,7,FTV host Jimmy Kimmel says his interview
OL,8,Fwith Democratic Senate candidate James
OL,9,FTalarico will not air on television due
OL,10,Fto pressure from the Federal
OL,11,FCommunications Commission (FCC).
OL,13,FSpeaking on his talk show, Jimmy Kimmel
OL,14,FLive!, on Wednesday, Kimmel said the
OL,15,FFCC, under Donald Trump's presidency,
OL,16,Fhad threatened him and his show "based
OL,17,Fon simple traditional editorial
OL,18,Fdecisions, guest bookings it would seem
OL,19,Fthey don't like". The BBC has contacted
OL,20,Fthe FCC for comment.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
